title: Bar_Start
---
Emuly: Yoo-Hooo! Howdy There! You look brand new around these parts, yer not from around here, are you?
    -> Pigeon: Came in on the last train
     Emuly:  I had a feeling! Fancy a drink?    
    -> Pigeon: I lived ‘ere my whole life
     Emuly:  Oh…well anyways, a drink for your troubles?

Pigeon: Oh, these are all the beaks I have..

Emuly: why did you come into a bar with barely any beaks-

Emuly: That’s okay! I can help ya get some more

Emuly: The way most people get their fix around here are these bounties, you-hoo get one of these and I can fix you up real nice

Pigeon: I gotta kill people for these drinks?

Emuly: Beaks grow back, are you in or not?
 -> Pigeon: Ay, why not   
  <<jump VinnyEnter>>
 -> Pigeon: Hell nah     
 <<jump VinnyEnter>>

===

title:VinnyEnter
position: 2,214
---
Vinny: WHERE DA HELL IS MY DRINK?

Bartender: Here you are, V, That’ll be 3 beaks

Vinny: Ya always ripping people off, jus hand me the drink, ’m almost done with my bounty

Bartender: You know how it is VV, no beaks, no drink

Vinny: Ya better be careful about who ya talking to here, we can settle this outside

Pidgeon: Why are ya yelling so damn loud…coming in here threatening people…

Vinny: …

Vinny: Who da hell are ya?

Pigeon: I’m Pigeon A. Holliday and I-

Vinny: I didn actually care, why are ya talking to me right now

Pigeon: Yer threatening a lowly bartender right now, yer out of line here

Bartender: lowly?

Vinny: Oh thank goodness ya were here then! I know exactly what ya doing and ya going to have to try harder than dat.

Pigeon: what

Vinny: Ya think ’m so stupid, I can smell it on ya

Vinny: Meet me outside, ’ll show ya what happens when people cross me.

<<jump BountyIntro>>



===
